Help for FT8 and FT4 reception

This Windows experiment uses the radio input and channel saved under Receive Audio Setup. Configure the Nexus engine, non-radio audio output and grid locator in yac.ini.

m) Switch between FT8 and FT4. This stops decoding and clears the results.
s) Start or stop decoding.
v) Read the latest message.
Comma) Read the previous message.
Full stop) Read the next message.
n) Clear the results.
q) Stop decoding and return. The selected mode and results stay for this YAC session.

